  "description": "The PDQ 2 combines two worlds thanks to its advanced geometry concept – the result is a bike that is efficient, fast, suitable for climbing and also great fun on downhills. 120 mm travel together with the long reach and 150 mm drop in the E13 Vario Infinite seatpost (can be shortened by 30 mm, in frame size XL 180mm) provide the PDQ with outstanding handling and give you a feeling of safety on every trail. The lightweight carbon frame offers the perfect balance of stiffness and flexibility to feel uncompromisingly fast. ¹ approx. 10.8 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for Oat Milk frame, size M, without pedals",
